(1. Why we built this \(Preventing Recurring Issues\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
39.6850393700787407 657.6380314960629221 Td
(Recurring issues happen because of manual errors or forgotten steps.) Tj
T* (This tool creates a standard checklist that every team member must follow.) Tj
T* (It calculates "Gaps" between tasks to ensure we never send reminders too fast or too slow.) Tj
T* (It provides a professional audit trail via PDF reports for every campaign.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 16 Tf
18.3999999999999986 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 544.2522047244094665 Td
(2. Key Features to Highlight) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
39.6850393700787407 515.9057480314959321 Td
(- Batch Management: Group tasks by campaign names.) Tj
T* (- Intelligent Timing: Automatic hour gap calculation between activities.) Tj
T* (- Progress Tracking: Visual bars showing how close we are to 100%.) Tj
T* (- Professional Export: One-click PDF for management reports.) Tj
T* (- Data Security: Build-in backup system to save and restore all data.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 16 Tf
18.3999999999999986 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 402.5199212598424765 Td
(3. How to Demo \(The Workflow\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
39.6850393700787407 374.1734645669290558 Td
(1. Start: Name your batch \(e.g., "April Market Prep"\) and click Save.) Tj
T* (2. Build: Add tasks with date and time. Watch the "Gap" calculate automatically.) Tj
T* (3. Execute: Check off tasks as you finish them. Watch the progress bar.) Tj
T* (4. Document: Click Export PDF to generate the official campaign report.) Tj
ET
